{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51537","headline":"云盖山泉 · 唐廪","name":"云盖山泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危峤高高几十层，梵王宫里一泉澄。\n引来石窦明如玉，泻落山厨冷似冰。\n净影不关秋赋客，清音时警夜禅僧。\n从兹渡口潺湲去，势入沧溟岂可仍。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐廪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}